 (text "POWER STAGE AND DC LINK  (block 1: Q1-Q4, block 2: Q5-Q8; one cell = HS + LS transistor + UFCS shunt in the LS source; AC of all four cells joined on the PCB)" (at 25.40 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2483b0a8-fe2d-5c81-8bb1-f57dc1a22a5a))
 (text "DC link, 60 capacitors: 40 x 1uF 100V X7S,  20 x 22uF 100V X7S 2220  (1 uF 0805: bypass at the HS drains of each cell, top + bottom; 22 uF 2220: bank)" (at 30.48 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 744eaf41-8255-59a6-a3f8-dfad15a94098))
