 (text "the bar passes through a LEM HO 250-S (off board," (at 604.52 105.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ec9f649a-5ef0-5aab-99b0-2011cdce030f))
 (text "3.2 mV/A, JST PHR-5 straight to the C2000)" (at 604.52 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e0ca3cf7-9581-547a-9125-b123d4ea52df))
 (text "DC link present LED, R45 100 k bleeder" (at 627.38 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b5be4d61-024b-5cc8-ba5c-cf5fd6230ddc))
 (text "GATE DRIVER BLOCKS: control header with common-mode chokes, 2EDF7275K input filters, R_ON / D + R_OFF, star, R_G per transistor (block 1 drives Q1-Q4, block 2 drives Q5-Q8)" (at 25.40 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ddd835d6-1742-557b-a879-9144dbd0b984))
 (text "BLOCK 1" (at 30.48 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ac316baa-0310-54fb-8e8f-21e92768d285))
 (text "NTC on the control side (board temperature at the driver)" (at 33.02 262.89 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e5098587-95d7-56ff-9f4d-cfed5c01f904))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 139.70 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c64700df-1cd3-5721-ae52-6c7c779e28dc))
 (text "R_ON 0.75 R, R_OFF 0 R (jumper), R_G 0.5 R per transistor, 10 k gate pull-down at the star to the Kelvin net" (at 139.70 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d358f4e4-d13e-5de1-a754-b3f6f91161ac))
 (text "BLOCK 2" (at 436.88 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 28e4655c-1a55-5e0c-baf3-a7de2441e873))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 546.10 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a2328803-eb71-5ff1-8492-ddd71092273f))
 (text "R_ON 0.75 R, R_OFF 0 R (jumper), R_G 0.5 R per transistor, 10 k gate pull-down at the star to the Kelvin net" (at 546.10 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9e401848-52de-55b0-8aed-8e8f2b649484))
 (text "GATE SUPPLY ISLANDS: external isolated supply (one HS, one LS, split per block) -> WE-CNSW -> 5.1 V Zener VDD-S, 150 R bias S-VEE: V_GS,on = +5.1 V, V_GS,off = -(V_ISO - 5.1 V)" (at 25.40 266.70 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1bef7a49-72f7-5a71-921b-36826ff9703f))
 (text "J3 / L1: HS block 1" (at 33.02 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ae8a2ede-1b5e-50aa-b49a-6f46b67f9daf))
 (text "J4 / L2: LS block 1" (at 236.22 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a5e12863-3988-534b-8d99-3941012feae5))
 (text "J12 / L8: HS block 2" (at 439.42 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ca54219c-fd8e-551c-b954-581a6bd402c5))
 (text "J13 / L9: LS block 2" (at 642.62 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a3d1272f-0c57-5b86-9e3a-381973155c69))
 (text "U.FL MEASUREMENT PORTS (bottom side, at each cell): V_GS HS / LS (0 R, shield = Kelvin), V_DS LS (953 R series = 20:1 into the 50 R scope input, shield = LS source LSRCx)" (at 25.40 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 53ceb923-26ee-5ba2-a8b4-c4f527099994))
 (text "MOUNTING: H1-H4 board corners (insulated); no heatsink (double-pulse board)" (at 25.40 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f84661ef-4063-5e2a-b984-6e37198e50ce))
 (text "Nets: DCP = DC+, DCN = DC-, SW = joined switch node of all four cells.  KH1/KH2 and KL1/KL2 are the Kelvin source nets (pad 2 of each EPC2361); they meet the power source only inside the package." (at 25.40 414.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b7ae7025-1ccb-5d56-925c-8c83ff2692d6))
 (text "LSRC1-LSRC4: LS power source of each cell = UFCS IN; the shunt SHLD side is DC-.  The LS gate drive and the LS supply are referenced to the Kelvin net KLx, not to DC-." (at 25.40 419.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7693ff31-ddf2-5c0d-940f-65d1ba2cdfcf))
 (text "Block suffix 1/2 on every driver-side net (GNDI1, VDDA2, ...).  Control side (CTRLx 2 x 5 header): PWM_H, PWM_L, DIS, 12 V and (block 1) NTC each with their own return C_RTN_* through one WE-CNSW common-mode choke per pair; 12 V then through a ferrite bead.  The control side is a top-layer-only area with a 1200 V barrier (4 mm outer, 3 mm L2) to all power copper; see reports/pcb-rules/PCB_rules_and_checklist.md." (at 25.40 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 30ed0a49-1769-5b7f-acf3-9dded309e8fe))
 (text "No short-circuit protection on this board.  Closed-loop control from a TI TMS320F28379D over the CTRL headers." (at 25.40 429.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9eed9c83-75d0-5f56-962f-6e8b2c5f4c7e))
